@ Poison Mushroom. The Super Mushroom's per-frame collect check (vtable +0xE0,
@ 0x60467F48: sub_60463998(item, &result, 1, 1)) starts with `push {r4, lr}`,
@ position-independent, so the trampoline can replay it.

PoisonMushroom_collect:
    type:       hook
    address:    0x00467F48
    symbol:     ModBase::poisonMushroom::collect(StageActor*)
    trampoline: ModBase::poisonMushroom::collect_orig(StageActor*)

@ Yoshi swallows what is in his mouth (0x607D05CC, the one place: every route calls it). Entry
@ `push {r4-r7, r11, lr}` is position-independent.
PoisonMushroom_swallow:
    type:       hook
    address:    0x007D05CC
    symbol:     ModBase::poisonMushroom::swallow(void*)
    trampoline: ModBase::poisonMushroom::swallow_orig(void*)
